---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects | Amierul Faiz" description="Selected projects focused on IoT efficiency and practical automation.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">Selected Work</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Automated Smart Pigeonhole Parcel Tracking System
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        A practical IoT solution designed to improve parcel visibility, reduce manual checks,
        and increase operational efficiency.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Project Overview</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Placeholder: Add a concise summary of the project, the problem it solves, and the
          impact it delivers.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Placeholder: Mention the core technologies used such as Raspberry Pi, Firebase,
          sensor automation, or a web dashboard.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Key Highlights</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          <li>• Placeholder: Real-time tracking and status updates.</li>
          <li>• Placeholder: Automated notifications for parcel movement.</li>
          <li>• Placeholder: Dashboard insights for efficient monitoring.</li>
          <li>• Placeholder: Scalable architecture for future expansion.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
